┄ [E-Bind] One name may have several binders, on histories that exclude each
┄ other. Binding it twice in one run is stuck.
control binders(a : u32) ■ { value {v : u32} }
⊤ ▷ t : ? a < 10
t.true ▷ x := 1
⊤ ▷ u : ? a < 5
u.true ▷ x := 2
u.false ∧ t.false ▷ x := 3
⊤ ▷ ■ value {x}

//! run binders(7) => done value {1}
//! run binders(20) => done value {3}
//! run binders(3) => stuck X3 E-Bind
